// Inti mascot poses, extracted from the designer files in the brand kit:
// inti-left.svg (t = -1), inti-front.svg (t = 0), inti-right.svg (t = +1).
// Every path has the same commands in the same order in all three poses, so
// the mascot morphs by interpolating the numbers. Do not edit by hand:
// re-extract from the SVGs if the artwork changes.

/** Path templates: each "#" is replaced by a number from the pose. */
